<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AES Corp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AES Corp raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it upgraded AES Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited AES's announcement that it landed a contract to build, to own and operate a 600 megawatt, gas-fired power plant in Brazil.</p>
<p>-- said its target price for the stock is $75. No time frame was provided.</p>
<p>-- AES gained 2-3/8 to 58-3/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
